Package: dendrogeo
Title: Read and Verify Public DendroGeo Scientific Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DendroGeo", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "sinan@dendrogeo.org")
Description: Read-only access to publicly released DendroGeo report metadata and
    analysis artifacts, with SHA-256 verification against immutable report manifests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    digest,
    httr2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/snansrin/dendrogeo
BugReports: https://github.com/snansrin/dendrogeo/issues
